@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

artifact ".ghost.md\n(front matter + ghost 코드)" as Src
component "컴파일러" as C
artifact "GFB + manifest\n(하드웨어와 무관하게 동일)" as G
artifact "hardwarePlan\n(파생)" as P
component "배포 소유자" as D

Src --> C
C --> G
C --> P
P --> D

note right of D : 고정된 프로필/모듈 해석,\nprovider schema로 config 검증,\n활성화 전 admission 검사
@enduml
